{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000563","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000563"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000563","label":"趙公子嘉","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"趙公子嘉","mention_ids":["c-shiji-006-shihuang:m015-0112","c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0103","c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0274"]},{"surface":"代王嘉","mention_ids":["c-shiji-006-shihuang:m019-0029","c-shiji-034-yan:m034-0028"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m015-0112","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p015","quote":"趙公子嘉"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m019-0029","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p019","quote":"代王嘉"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0103","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021","quote":"趙公子嘉"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0274","chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p032","quote":"趙公子嘉"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m034-0028","chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p034","quote":"代王嘉"}],"identity_note":"依本卷特定時代與事件暫定人物；不以同稱、官號或短名全域合併，未見本名不補造。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m015-0112","start":112,"end":116,"surface":"趙公子嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000563","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m019-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"代王嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000563","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p019","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0103","start":103,"end":107,"surface":"趙公子嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000563","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0274","start":274,"end":278,"surface":"趙公子嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000563","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p032","chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m034-0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"代王嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000563","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p034","chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji034-055","person_id":"cbr-p000563","title":"代王","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"self_proclamation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan","source_id":"s-shiji-034-yan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p032","quote":"二十七年，秦虜趙王遷，滅趙。趙公子嘉自立爲代王。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji034-055:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p032","start":281,"end":283,"surface":"代王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0274","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"self_proclamation","date_expression":"二十七年","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan","source_id":"s-shiji-034-yan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p032","quote":"二十七年，秦虜趙王遷，滅趙。趙公子嘉自立爲代王。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"燕王喜敘事二十七年嘉自立代王，保留來源紀年；後段虜代王嘉未自動當廢爵終點。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji034-044","person_id":"cbr-p000563","surfaces":["代王嘉","趙公子嘉"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-006-shihuang","c-shiji-034-yan"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p015","quote":"十八年，大興兵攻趙，王翦將上地，下井陘，端和將河內，羌瘣伐趙，端和圍邯鄲城。十九年，王翦、羌瘣盡定取趙地東陽，得趙王。引兵欲攻燕，屯中山。秦王之邯鄲，諸嘗與王生趙時母家有仇怨，皆阬之。秦王還，從太原、上郡歸。始皇帝母太后崩。趙公子嘉率其宗數百人之代，自立為代王，東與燕合兵，軍上谷。大饑。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p032","quote":"六年，秦滅東（西）周，置三川郡。七年，秦拔趙楡次三十七城，秦置大原郡。九年，秦王政初卽位。十年，趙使廉頗將攻繁陽，拔之。趙孝成王卒，悼襄王立。使樂乘代廉頗，廉頗不聽，攻樂乘，樂乘走，廉頗奔大梁。十二年，趙使李牧攻燕，拔武遂、方城。劇辛故居趙，與龐煖善，已而亡走燕。燕見趙數困于秦，而廉頗去，令龐煖將也，欲因趙獘攻之。問劇辛，辛曰：「龐煖易與耳。」燕使劇辛將撃趙，趙使龐煖撃之，取燕軍二萬，殺劇辛。秦拔魏二十城，置東郡。十九年，秦拔趙之鄴九城。趙悼襄王卒。二十三年，太子丹質於秦，亡歸燕。二十五年，秦虜滅韓王安，置潁川郡。二十七年，秦虜趙王遷，滅趙。趙公子嘉自立爲代王。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p034","quote":"三十三年，秦拔遼東，虜燕王喜，卒滅燕。是歳，秦將王賁亦虜代王嘉。"}],"rationale":"依周初封建、燕君世系、割地救燕、讓國及秦滅諸國的具體語境暫定異稱。繼位不自動證父子；同爵者分國別與前後世代。太子平／燕昭王依本篇明示，不表示年代及世系已校定。作君奭為書名，君奭不説之君奭才暫解召公稱呼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p015","text":"十八年，大興兵攻趙，王翦將上地，下井陘，端和將河內，羌瘣伐趙，端和圍邯鄲城。十九年，王翦、羌瘣盡定取趙地東陽，得趙王。引兵欲攻燕，屯中山。秦王之邯鄲，諸嘗與王生趙時母家有仇怨，皆阬之。秦王還，從太原、上郡歸。始皇帝母太后崩。趙公子嘉率其宗數百人之代，自立為代王，東與燕合兵，軍上谷。大饑。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m015-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"王翦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000557","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m015-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"端和","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000551","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m015-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"羌瘣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000562","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m015-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"端和","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000551","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m015-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"王翦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000557","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m015-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"羌瘣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000562","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m015-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"趙王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m015-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"秦王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m015-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"母家","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m015-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"秦王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m015-0107","start":107,"end":110,"surface":"母太后","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m015-0112","start":112,"end":116,"surface":"趙公子嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000563","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m015-0128","start":128,"end":130,"surface":"代王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p019","text":"二十五年，大興兵，使王賁將，攻燕遼東，得燕王喜。還攻代，虜代王嘉。王翦遂定荊江南地；降越君，置會稽郡。五月，天下大酺。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m019-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"王賁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000567","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m019-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"燕王喜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000569","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m019-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"代王嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000563","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m019-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"王翦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000557","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m019-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"越君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021","text":"秦王初并天下，令丞相、御史曰：「異日韓王納地效璽，請為藩臣，已而倍約，與趙、魏合從畔秦，故興兵誅之，虜其王。寡人以為善，庶幾息兵革。趙王使其相李牧來約盟，故歸其質子。已而倍盟，反我太原，故興兵誅之，得其王。趙公子嘉乃自立為代王，故舉兵擊滅之。魏王始約服入秦，已而與韓、趙謀襲秦，秦兵吏誅，遂破之。荊王獻青陽以西，已而畔約，擊我南郡，故發兵誅，得其王，遂定其荊地。燕王昏亂，其太子丹乃陰令荊軻為賊，兵吏誅，滅其國。齊王用后勝計，絕秦使，欲為亂，兵吏誅，虜其王，平齊地。寡人以眇眇之身，興兵誅暴亂，賴宗廟之靈，六王咸伏其辜，天下大定。今名號不更，無以稱成功，傳後世。其議帝號。」丞相綰、御史大夫劫、廷尉斯等皆曰：「昔者五帝地方千里，其外侯服夷服諸侯或朝或否，天子不能制。今陛下興義兵，誅殘賊，平定天下，海內為郡縣，法令由一統，自上古以來未嘗有，五帝所不及。臣等謹與博士議曰：『古有天皇，有地皇，有泰皇，泰皇最貴。』臣等昧死上尊號，王為『泰皇』。命為『制』，令為『詔』，天子自稱曰『朕』。」王曰：「去『泰』，著『皇』，采上古『帝』位號，號曰『皇帝』；他如議。」制曰：「可。」追尊莊襄王為太上皇。制曰：「朕聞太古有號毋謚，中古有號，死而以行為謐。如此，則子議父，臣議君也，甚無謂，朕弗取焉。自今已來，除謚法。朕為始皇帝。後世以計數，二世三世至于萬世，傳之無窮。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000533","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0008","start":8,"end":13,"surface":"丞相、御史","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"韓王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"趙王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"李牧","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000572","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0103","start":103,"end":107,"surface":"趙公子嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000563","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0111","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"代王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0121","start":121,"end":123,"surface":"魏王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":n