號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0388","start":388,"end":390,"surface":"天皇","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0392","start":392,"end":394,"surface":"地皇","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0396","start":396,"end":398,"surface":"泰皇","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0399","start":399,"end":401,"surface":"泰皇","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0416","start":416,"end":418,"surface":"泰皇","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0486","start":486,"end":489,"surface":"莊襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000310","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0490","start":490,"end":493,"surface":"太上皇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000310","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0552","start":552,"end":555,"surface":"始皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000533","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0562","start":562,"end":566,"surface":"二世三世","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p032","text":"六年，秦滅東（西）周，置三川郡。七年，秦拔趙楡次三十七城，秦置大原郡。九年，秦王政初卽位。十年，趙使廉頗將攻繁陽，拔之。趙孝成王卒，悼襄王立。使樂乘代廉頗，廉頗不聽，攻樂乘，樂乘走，廉頗奔大梁。十二年，趙使李牧攻燕，拔武遂、方城。劇辛故居趙，與龐煖善，已而亡走燕。燕見趙數困于秦，而廉頗去，令龐煖將也，欲因趙獘攻之。問劇辛，辛曰：「龐煖易與耳。」燕使劇辛將撃趙，趙使龐煖撃之，取燕軍二萬，殺劇辛。秦拔魏二十城，置東郡。十九年，秦拔趙之鄴九城。趙悼襄王卒。二十三年，太子丹質於秦，亡歸燕。二十五年，秦虜滅韓王安，置潁川郡。二十七年，秦虜趙王遷，滅趙。趙公子嘉自立爲代王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0005","start":5,"end":10,"surface":"東（西）周","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0038","start":38,"end":41,"surface":"秦王政","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000533","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000638","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0060","start":60,"end":64,"surface":"趙孝成王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001370","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0066","start":66,"end":69,"surface":"悼襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000813","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001369","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000638","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000638","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001369","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001369","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000638","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"李牧","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000572","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"劇辛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001358","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"龐煖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001371","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0132","start":132,"end":133,"surface":"燕","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"國家／國君或執政主語尚未細定，不把純地名當人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0141","start":141,"end":143,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000638","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0146","start":146,"end":148,"surface":"龐煖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001371","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0159","start":159,"end":161,"surface":"劇辛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001358","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0162","start":162,"end":163,"surface":"辛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001358","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0166","start":166,"end":168,"surface":"龐煖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001371","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0173","start":173,"end":174,"surface":"燕","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"國家／國君或執政主語尚未細定，不把純地名當人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0175","start":175,"end":177,"surface":"劇辛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001358","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0183","start":183,"end":185,"surface":"龐煖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001371","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0195","start":195,"end":197,"surface":"劇辛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001358","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0221","start":221,"end":225,"surface":"趙悼襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000813","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0232","start":232,"end":235,"surface":"太子丹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000564","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0251","start":251,"end":254,"surface":"韓王安","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000560","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0267","start":267,"end":270,"surface":"趙王遷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001372","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m032-0274","start":274,"end":278,"surface":"趙公子嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000563","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan","book_id":"b-shiji-034","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-034-yan"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p034","text":"三十三年，秦拔遼東，虜燕王喜，卒滅燕。是歳，秦將王賁亦虜代王嘉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m034-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"燕王喜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000569","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m034-0022","start":22,"end":26,"surface":"秦將王賁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000567","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m034-0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"代王嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000563","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan","book_id":"b-shiji-034","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-034-yan"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-006","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang","source":{"title":"史記／卷006","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷006","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷006&oldid=7907969","revision_id":7907969,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"數位見證127個文字區塊，含16個dd刻辭或嵌入引文及卷末附載班固記；排除導覽、跨站連結與註號。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文與附載文字；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"note":"正文未改寫；行內校勘標記及附載文字仍待逐處核對。固定版本正文HTML重讀一致。","editorial_readings":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p010","witness_form":"（四）［是］","body_reading":"四","note":"數位見證行內校勘標記另存；正文保留改讀前的字，不稱已校定